<title>UK: Redland H1 profits at lower end of range.</title>
<headline>Redland H1 profits at lower end of range.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.8		    vs 14.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.5		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     95.0		   vs 165.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,184		  vs 1,296</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 86 million to 130 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 19.7		   vs 26.0</p>
<p> Interest payable	 21.6		   vs 16.9</p>
<p> Tax			  26.5		   vs 55.1</p>
<p> Net taxed		  69.0		   vs 110.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 16</p>
<p> Div registration date  Nov 5</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Oct 28</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
